# Guard film: the major termite soldier (the biggest body, its legs set forward under its heavy head) walking at the
# three speeds, then turning on the spot both ways seen from above: its feet must stay put on the ground while the
# body passes over them, and step round as it turns (docs/plans/termite-walks.md).
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
lens 30
walker termite_major_soldier -9.5 -60 0.5 -90
log soldier
cmd tick freeze
fov 10
follow 0 0.2 -8 0 0
go -4 -60 0 0.4
burst slow 40 1
go 2 -60 0 1.0
burst normal 30 1
go 8 -60 0 1.8
burst fast 30 1
burst stop 40 1
follow 0 2.6 0 0 90
look 8 -60 -8
burst left_above 30 1
look 8 -60 8
burst right_above 30 1
look off
log off
follow off
quit
